  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'You are the Manager of the Restaurant called "The big B" and since everything
    works fine, you decide to take a quick nap. As you wake up you notice that everone
    is gone and that it smells like fire. And this is what you encounter as you enter
    the main dining hall. A fire blocking the exit.

    Your task is to escape the
    restaurant and save yourself.

    To do this, you need to find clues and solve
    puzzles to get the fire extinguisher and extinguish the fire.

    You can move
    with the file keys and rotate by klicking and holding the mouse curser.

    With
    the curser you can klick on objects and some of them might be saved in your inventar
    and which can be applied at another place.

    On the bottom right you see a
    map for orientation and you can pause the game with the button in the left bottom
    corner.

    Have fun and good luck!'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
